":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Lawrence County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. On that middle, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, November to December came in at 47% and July to August at 58%. In 2026 so far, February to March sat at 43% and June to July at 133%.</p>"}
